        "created_at": "2013-01-26T08:19:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"NAL0781\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nal0781/48/2041_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> NAL0781:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Bad shuffling???&nbsp; Please join the club… Or maybe it's just selective shuffling because I don't want to damage my Sentinels cards.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It's horrible, I was playing at a local gameshop and we were on the mars base. All three alien tech cards, one right after the other, everybody at the table just started giving me this look. And this isn't just with environments, every deck seems to have one type of card congregated no matter what I do, so Blade hits us with multiple Hasten Dooms or Insula Primalis gets that stupid toxic vegetation round after round. Tachyon only draws her \"punch and draw\" card. It drives me insane.</p>",
